{{Documentation}}
Template to display login stamps during events and such. See [[Module:Stamps/doc]] for information on how to update the available stamps.

==Usage==
<pre>{{Stamps|bg=|gradient=|item1|item1description|item2|item2description|...}}</pre>

==Example Usage==
<tabber>
Without Bg=
<pre>
{{Stamps|Treasure Radar|[[Treasure Radar]] + 654
|Rich Cat|Multiple [[Rich Cat]]s
|Shakurel Cat|chin
}}
</pre>

===Result===
{{Stamps|Treasure Radar|[[Treasure Radar]] + 654
|Rich Cat|Multiple [[Rich Cat]]s
|Shakurel Cat|chin
}}

|-|With Bg=
<pre>
{{Stamps|bg=0
|Speed Up|"[[Battle Items#Speed Up|Speed Up]]" power up +5
|Rich Cat|"[[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]]" power up +4
|Rare Ticket|"[[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Ticket]]" +1
|Cat CPU|"[[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]]" power up +3
|Cat Ticket|"[[Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]]" +2
|Rare Ticket|"[[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Ticket]]" +1
|Treasure Radar|"[[Battle Items#Treasure Radar|Treasure Radar]]" power up +1
|Sniper the Cat|"[[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]]" power up +4
|Rare Ticket|"[[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Ticket]]" +1
}}
</pre>

